    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST MY NEW GAME!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Underworld Idle is an idle game about underworld management.<br><br>The basic mechanics: higher-order units create lower-order units. If you've played games like Swarm Simulator or Antimatter Dimensions, you should be familiar with these mechanics. However, in Underworld Idle I present my own take on these mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Factions (demons, undead, utopians, and blackseekers). Each faction is responsible for producing its own resource. <br></li><li>Mechanics of creating units. For example, higher demons create lower demons, and so on. The same about units of undead, drowners and warlocks.<br></li><li>Infinite progression. Start with a small number of resources and expand into a long list of units and huge numbers.<br></li><li>Infernal Contracts - Prestige Mechanics.<br></li><li>A variety of locations: lab with energy crystals, junkyard, library with grimoire (containing dark spells).</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Underworld Idle is an idle game about underworld management.<br><br>The basic mechanics: higher-order units create lower-order units. If you've played games like Swarm Simulator or Antimatter Dimensions, you should be familiar with these mechanics. However, in Underworld Idle I present my own take on these mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Factions (demons, undead, utopians, and blackseekers). Each faction is responsible for producing its own resource. <br></li><li>Mechanics of creating units. For example, higher demons create lower demons, and so on. The same about units of undead, drowners and warlocks.<br></li><li>Infinite progression. Start with a small number of resources and expand into a long list of units and huge numbers.<br></li><li>Infernal Contracts - Prestige Mechanics.<br></li><li>A variety of locations: lab with energy crystals, junkyard, library with grimoire (containing dark spells).</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An idle dungeon management game, where high tier units can create low tier units.",
